<p data-structure="Section" id="p_19">18. 	From the careful perusal of the rate schedules, as approved for the Financial Year 2022-23 by the U.P. State Regulatory Commission it is apparent that the activities of advocates and professionals or the public institutions like Judiciary do not find place in any of the rate schedule.   Clause 13 of the general provisions with regard to rate schedule for Financial Year 2022-23 provides as under:-
